{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10127140","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10127140","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1012714001:0":{"text":"땅거미 숲은 이제 무사하니, 어디로 갈 건가요? 우선은 성석 마을로 돌아갈 건가요?","source_cn":"薄暮丛林没事了，你们接下来打算去哪？先回圣石镇吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8199646D818EDB38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1012714002:0":{"text":"발렌이 난민 영지에서 기다리고 있으니 두고 갈 순 없죠.","source_cn":"维伦还在难民营地等我们，可不能把他落下。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x48C1F3C8EA45722A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1012714003:0":{"text":"아, 까먹을 뻔했네... 그럼 난민 영지로 가서 발렌 씨와 함께 성석 마을로 돌아가자.","source_cn":"啊，差点忘了这家伙……去难民营地找他吧，然后大家一起回...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A0E6F7961214402","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"로잔","source":"洛桑","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":3}}